{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22399","headline":"病中友人相访 · 白居易","name":"病中友人相访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧久不记日，南窗昏复昏。\n萧条草檐下，寒雀朝夕闻。\n强扶牀前杖，起向庭中行。\n偶逢故人至，便当一逢迎。\n移榻就斜日，披裘倚前楹。\n闲谈胜服药，稍觉有心情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}